&lt;li&gt;Practical experience executing in CEP systems such as Braze&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with marketing and analytical tools like Segment, Mixpanel, and Preset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self starter who is data-driven, results-oriented and customer-obsessed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, able to clarify complex ideas in a way that a broad audience can understand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a fast paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web3 experience will be a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
